<title>LATVIA: Latvian T-bill yields tumble.</title>
<headline>Latvian T-bill yields tumble.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields at an auction of Latvian Treasury bills fell on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD	 LAST  NO OF BANKS    ISSUE  BID SOLD</p>
<p> One month    3.53	  3.66	 4	    0.5   1.0  0.5</p>
<p> Three-month  3.89	  4.14	 6	    0.7   1.97 0.7</p>
<p> Six-month    5.04	  5.33	 10	   2.0   5.85 2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
